  "assembly.imported.draftHint": "For example a Flye draft made with your own pipeline from the same reads. ARVA records what you declare (it cannot check it) and then lets you polish the draft with this sample's reads: Racon or Medaka with long reads, Pilon with short reads. Leave it unticked for a finished genome such as an NCBI RefSeq genome.",
