  "unicycler.readsHint": "The roles decide the mode: short reads only, long reads only, or both (hybrid). Short and long reads must come from the same isolate.",
  "unicycler.modeLine.short": "Mode: short-read assembly (SPAdes over several k-mer sizes; the best graph is kept and bridged with SPAdes' read-pair paths).",
