  "unicycler.longNote": "For long reads alone Flye is ARVA's main assembler, and Unicycler's author recommends long-read-first assembly when long reads are deep. In this mode Unicycler 0.5.0 writes no depth or circularity in the FASTA headers; ARVA reads them from its assembly graph.",
