  "perf.image.reason.rosetta_default": "Apple silicon: the amd64 image, so that every ARVA tool is available. Docker Desktop's settings file does not store the Rosetta setting (it keeps only settings changed from Docker Desktop's defaults, and Docker's documentation does not say consistently what the default is); nothing failed. If the setting is off, Docker uses the much slower QEMU.",
