  "perf.notes.memory": "Memory limits apply only to tools that have one: SPAdes (-m), SPAdes inside Unicycler, Pilon (Java -Xmx) and samtools sort (per thread). Flye, Racon, minimap2, BWA, QUAST, Bakta, Prokka, fastp, FastQC, SeqKit, NanoPlot, Filtlong and MultiQC have none: give them fewer threads instead.",
