  "databases.kind.mobsuite.recognise": "clusters.txt, rep.dna.fas, mob.proteins.faa, mpf.proteins.faa, orit.fas, repetitive.dna.fas and host_range_literature_plasmidDB.txt; the BLAST indexes of ncbi_plasmid_full_seqs.fas (with -parse_seqids) and repetitive.dna.fas, ncbi_plasmid_full_seqs.fas.msh and taxa.sqlite show that the folder was prepared (by mob_init, with status.txt, or by ARVA, with ARVA_DATABASE.json). The FASTA ncbi_plasmid_full_seqs.fas itself is optional: mob_recon 3.1.9 searches only its BLAST index.",
  "databases.kind.mobsuite.version_from": "ARVA_DATABASE.json, written when ARVA prepared the folder (3.1.8); a folder mob_init prepared states only its download date (status.txt): declared by you.",
